OL,3,AGlobal tech stocks plunge as US AI
OL,4,Aslowdown fears spread to Asia and
OL,5,AEurope markets
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe value of tech stocks has plummeted
OL,8,Faround the world amid fears of a
OL,9,Fslowdown in AI development
OL,11,FIt comes after the US midterm
OL,12,Felections, won by the Democrats, where
OL,13,Fdata centres became a key issue for
OL,14,Fvoters - BBC Verify looks at polling
OL,15,Fdata
OL,17,FThe Nasdaq index, of the largest tech
OL,18,Ffirms listed in the US, was down by
OL,19,Fmore than 5.5% on Thursday; Japan's
OL,20,FNikkei 225 was down 6.3% earlier; and
OL,21,Fthe UK's FTSE 100 index has fallen by
OL,22,F1.6%
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,107,105,200,300,0,100
