OL,3,AGlobal tech stocks plunge as US AI
OL,4,Aslowdown fears spread to Asia and
OL,5,AEurope markets
OL,6,
OL,7,FDespite its dramatic drop, Nasdaq is
OL,8,Fstill higher now than it was last
OL,9,FNovember and 4.6% above its position at
OL,10,Fthe start of the year - take a look at
OL,11,Fthis chart
OL,13,FTudor Brown, a UK tech founder, tells
OL,14,Fthe BBC there were "jitters" around
OL,15,F"infinite AI growth" before the
OL,16,Fmidterms. He says there's "a lot of
OL,17,Fmoney still being made in these
OL,18,Fcompanies and we'll start to see it
OL,19,Fcoming back a bit"
